steps.text:
Configure the cursor commands with `logicalLine: true` in `keybindings.json`:

```json
[
  {
    "key": "ctrl+alt+down",
    "command": "editor.action.insertCursorBelow",
    "args": { "logicalLine": true }
  },
  {
    "key": "ctrl+alt+up",
    "command": "editor.action.insertCursorAbove",
    "args": { "logicalLine": true }
  }
]
```

This makes cursor addition move by actual document lines, skipping word-wrap continuation lines. The default behavior uses visual (wrapped) lines.
